<title>USA: Bio-Vascular to buy up to 500,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Bio-Vascular to buy up to 500,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bio-Vascular Inc said Tuesday its directors have authorized the repurchase of up to 500,000 of the company's 9.5 million common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The company said shares will be purchased from time-to-time in the open market to take advantage of price opportunities as they arise.</p>
<p>The shares repurchased will be used by the company in connection with future company stock transactions.</p>
<p>Bio-Vascular makes and markets medical products for use in thoracic, cardiac, neuro and vascular surgery.</p>
<p>Shares of Bio-Vascular were trading up 1/4 to 4-1/4.</p>
<p>		  ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
